   111		11: Vector2(16.5, -23), 14: Vector2(2.0, -40), 17: Vector2(5.5, -36), 21: Vector2(0.5, -33)}   # V1.3.1：羊、幽靈、骷髏法師、骷髏也吃得到表情（Codex v131-impl1）
